Thank you for contacting RingCentral Customer Success! We have received your inquiry and our team is reviewing it. We will provide an update to the customer listed in this escalation within 24 business hours. You can also check the update on the account under case number #{!$Record.CaseNumber}
Thank you! RingCentral Customer Success
*Please do not reply to this email acknowledgement, kindly refer to the CERT case in the account for reference.

A support case has been received and requires agent assignment via RingCX. Please identify and assign an appropriate agent, then update the case owner in Salesforce.

